      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. it just feels like a mathematical error. like, if the universe is just random and nothing we do has a permanent impact, then there's no difference between being here and not being here. it's all just zero in the end. it's hard to see why 'resistance' matters if the outcome is always going to be empty.",
